        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SSPBB1210, Contemporary Stainless Steel Back-to-Back Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Back-to-Back 12 Inch Contemporary Pull Set comes with everything you'll need to install the pair of handles back to back on your door. It comes packaged with installation kits for glass, fiberglass, wood, or metal doors. It is made out of stainless steel in your choice of brushed stainless steel, polished stainless steel, or black finishes. This 12 Inch center to center door pull has a 13 inch overall length and a 1 inch grip. The Deltana Contemporary Stainless Steel Pulls are an affordable way to add modern style to any door.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Includes rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SSPBB1210-specifications.gif?v=1704354736\" width=\"549\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" atl=\"Deltana SSPBB1210 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available as an individual <a href=\"/products/12-inch-contemporary-pull-deltana-ssp1210\"><b>Deltana SSP1210 Contemporary 12\" Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Square Stainless Steel Handle Back to Back Pair:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-7/8\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Screws: 8 mm x 1.25 mm</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for glass, fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SSPBB1210-specifciations.pdf?v=1704262343\"><b>Deltana SSPBB1210 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back to Back mounting</b>.\r\n</p>",
