                "description": "The Back-to-Back 12 Inch Contemporary Pull Set comes with everything you'll need to install the pair of handles back to back on your door. It comes packaged with installation kits for glass, fiberglass, wood, or metal doors. It is made out of stainless steel in your choice of brushed stainless steel, polished stainless steel, or black finishes. This 12 Inch center to center door pull has a 13 inch overall length and a 1 inch grip. The Deltana Contemporary Stainless Steel Pulls are an affordable way to add modern style to any door.\r\n",
